<section class="info-hero"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">Warranty</span><h1>Warranty and Product Condition Confirmation</h1><p>Warranty duration and coverage may vary by product, material and order type. Confirm the exact terms in writing before ordering.</p></div></section><section class="container section-space info-page"><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="policy-card"><h2>Before Ordering</h2><ul><li>Ask whether the selected model has a warranty and its duration.</li><li>Request clear coverage and exclusions.</li><li>Keep the order confirmation, invoice or proof of payment.</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="policy-card"><h2>If a Problem Appears</h2><ul><li>Contact Nestica as soon as you notice the issue.</li><li>Send clear photos and video.</li><li>Avoid third-party repairs before the case is reviewed.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="container info-alert"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i><div><h2>The Written Order Confirmation Contains the Final Terms</h2><p>This page explains the general process and does not create unconfirmed coverage for any product.</p></div></section>
